      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "The present petition has been filed under 482 Cr.P.C praying for issuance of directions to respondents no.3 & 4 to arrest the accused persons in case FIR No.107 dated 10.4.2023 registered under sections 34, 406, 420 IPC at Police Station, City Mahendergarh,\nDistrict Mahendergarh and investigate the matter fairly and constitute a S.I.T. Notice of motion.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 468,
      "end": 824,
      "entities": [
        {
